  "notes": "Metres, Z up, front -X. Applied transforms in the shared prop frame. Cycles CPU 64-sample diffuse COLOR times (0.4 + 0.6 AO), sRGB8 albedo; PBR and artwork packed in source.blend. DejaVu Sans Bold, English only. Task 15 uses isolated finalization to protect existing props. A 22 mm lower socket collar reconciles the specified 200 mm mast and 440 mm approximate height. Two bracket collision boxes preserve the L rather than filling its notch. Collar has its own proxy. Task 13 delivery: baked albedos are Lanczos-downsampled to at most 1024 px except the unchanged-resolution factory-floor repeat tile; previews are 512 square. PNG encoding uses RGB8 or reviewed 256-colour Floyd-Steinberg palettes; source artwork pixels and source.blend are retained. Shared PNG paths resolve from this prop folder. Task 13 compact OBJ exception: positions use 5 decimal metres where safe; necessary vertices retain up to 6 decimals to preserve nonzero triangles, strict collision convexity and the 0.005 mm Euclidean movement bound. Independent fixed-5 rounding cannot satisfy all three. Normals/UVs use 4 decimals; every original triangle, position index and per-corner attribute value is retained. Equal rounded UV records share indices and visual OBJ indices use shorter equivalent relative notation. No collision remeshing, reindexing or simplification.",
